// fluidview — the shared eyes of the fluid demos: window, camera, software painter, HUD and the drawing of
// terrain, water and streaks.
//
// `geyser`, `intermittent` and `river` each demonstrate one behaviour of `ludax`'s `FluidWorld`; what they
// share is only how a world is looked at, so that is all this package holds. It has no simulation of its own
// and imports nothing but `ludax` and `smalt`. A demo owns its terrain, its sim, its scene (what it draws
// besides the shared terrain and water) and its HUD layout.

